# serialarm-core
===
 The C++17 dynamics kernel for serial robotic arms decouples the robot model, hardware interface and upper-layer framework, provides rigid body dynamics calculation, gravity compensation and dynamics calibration, and is equipped with the SerialArm Studio workbench to support ROS 2 access and cross-project reuse..
